Title:  The Nirvana Antipattern

Seq:    12.6.26.1.1

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Brown, William J., McCormick, Hays W. and Thomas, Scott W.|Brown, William J., McCormick, Hays W., Thomas and Scott W.]], 1999, from the book *[[Anti-Patterns and Patterns in Software Configuration Management]]*

